  "project_description": "This modules create a field formatter for fields of type viewfield to allow placing each item in a different tab.\n\n Features \n The title and an array of behaviours to be attached can be set for each tab.\n\n Post-Installation \n Go to manage display for an entity with a view field, and choose the \"Tabby viewfield\" format.\n\nEdit the settings to set each tab title, and any behaviours that should be attached.\n\n Additional Requirements \n This module relies on tabby .\n\n Back to top",
